{%- comment -%}
  Quantity breaks V2: a guide inside the old Quantity selector (with quantity discounts on) that lists where each of
  its settings lives in Quantity breaks V2. Nothing can be moved automatically, because a block can't read another
  block's settings. blocks/product_quantity-selector.liquid renders it after the old widget while
  request.design_mode is true, so customers never get it. It starts collapsed, is English only like the Discount
  setup panel of Quantity breaks V2, and has no ids or form controls (quick add has nothing to rewrite).

  Usage:
  {%- if request.design_mode -%}{%- render 'qb-v2-migration' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.design_mode -%}
  <details class="qb-v2-migrate">
    <summary class="qb-v2-migrate__summary">
      <span>Moving to Quantity breaks V2</span>
      <span class="qb-v2-migrate__note">Only you see this</span>
    </summary>
    <style>
      details.qb-v2-migrate {
        direction: ltr;
        margin: 0.8rem 0 1.5rem;
        border: 1px dashed rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.35);
        border-radius: 8px;
        background: rgb(var(--color-background));
        color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.45;
        letter-spacing: normal;
        text-align: start;
        text-transform: none;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__summary {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 4px 10px;
        padding: 10px 12px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: 700;
        list-style: none;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__summary::before {
        content: '';
        flex: none;
        width: 6px;
        height: 6px;
        margin-inline: 2px 1px;
        border: solid currentColor;
        border-width: 0 2px 2px 0;
        rotate: -45deg;
        transition: rotate 0.15s ease;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate[open] > .qb-v2-migrate__summary::before {
        rotate: 45deg;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__summary:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground));
        outline-offset: -2px;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__note {
        margin-inline-start: auto;
        color: rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.75);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__body {
        display: grid;
        gap: 10px;
        padding: 0 12px 12px;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__body :is(p, ol) {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__steps {
        display: grid;
        gap: 4px;
        padding-inline-start: 18px;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        table-layout: fixed;
        font-size: inherit;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__table :is(th, td) {
        padding: 5px 10px 5px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.12);
        font-weight: 400;
        text-align: start;
        vertical-align: top;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__table :is(th, td):last-child {
        padding-inline-end: 0;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__table thead th {
        border-top: 0;
        color: rgba(var(--color-foreground), 0.75);
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__table thead th:first-child {
        width: 46%;
      }

      .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__table .qb-v2-migrate__group th {
        padding-top: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .qb-v2-migrate .qb-v2-migrate__summary::before {
          transition: none;
        }
      }
    </style>
    <div class="qb-v2-migrate__body">
      <ol class="qb-v2-migrate__steps">
        <li>Add a Quantity breaks V2 block to this section, with one Quantity option per offer.</li>
        <li>Settings don't move over by themselves. The table matches each one to its new setting.</li>
        <li>Remove this block when you're done. Both can't run in one section, so until then customers see this one and the new one stays dimmed.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Discounts you created in Shopify admin keep working. The Discount setup panel under the new widget checks them.</p>
      <table class="qb-v2-migrate__table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">This block</th>
            <th scope="col">New setting</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="qb-v2-migrate__group"><th scope="rowgroup" colspan="2">Quantity breaks V2 block</th></tr>
          <tr><td>Heading</td><td>Heading</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Style</td><td>Options layout</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Prices layout</td><td>Price layout</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Display selected indicator in Classic &amp; Compact style</td><td>Indicator style</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Corner radius</td><td>Corner radius</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Border width</td><td>Border thickness</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Images width</td><td>Image size</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Colors, Color scheme, Text accent color</td><td>Color scheme, Accent color, and Card style in each option</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Variant selectors</td><td>Picker style, Item labels</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Hide &amp; automatically skip sold out variants</td><td>Show sold-out values, turned off</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Scroll to the selected variant image in product images gallery</td><td>Update gallery image</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Update displayed product page prices</td><td>Product price display</td></tr>
        </tbody>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="qb-v2-migrate__group"><th scope="rowgroup" colspan="2">Each Quantity option</th></tr>
          <tr><td>Quantity</td><td>Quantity</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Preselected option</td><td>Selected by default</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Percentage off, Fixed amount off</td><td>Discount type, then Percentage or Amount</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Compare price based on</td><td>Compare price based on</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Label, Benefit, Caption</td><td>Title, Label, Subtitle</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Price text, Compare price text</td><td>Price, Compare price</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Image</td><td>Image</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Badge text, Badge style, Badge color scheme</td><td>Badge</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Enable variant selectors</td><td>Show variant pickers</td></tr>
        </tbody>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="qb-v2-migrate__group"><th scope="rowgroup" colspan="2">Blocks in a Quantity option (Upsell/Gift #N)</th></tr>
          <tr><td>Type: Gift (auto-added)</td><td>Free gift</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Type: Checkbox</td><td>Checkbox upsell</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Type: Checkbox – preselected</td><td>Checkbox upsell with Selected by default</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Minimum offer required</td><td>The option you add the block to. A Free gift also shows in bigger options. To offer an upsell with every option, add it to the Quantity breaks V2 block instead.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </details>
{%- endif -%}
